# WFORMTH.KEY - the limits of the fields: TEXT 12 characters, CODE
# LINK_LOCLEN folded to upper case, QTY 5, PRICE LINK_PRICELEN, DATE
# FORM_DATEW, PASS LINK_PWMAX; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTH.SNP.
K F5
T abcdefghijklmn
K TAB
T abcdefgh
K TAB
T 1234567
K TAB
T 123456789012
K TAB
T 2026-10-08999
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 0123456789abcdefghij
S LIMITS
# PRICE holds 9 integer digits, more than a number of width 9 with 2
# decimals fits: the first bad field is PRICE.
K ENTER
S BADPRICE
K HOME SHIFT-END
T 12.5
K ENTER
S BADCOND
# Choose a row, and every field passes.
K DOWN ENTER
S PASSED
